       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is double the usual maximum single dose of ibuprofen, which is 800 mg.\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The maximum is 3,200 mg/day for prescription use in adults, and 1,200 mg/day for OTC use. At this total, the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events goes up substantially.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the usual maximum for inflammatory conditions.\n- **400\u2013600 mg by mouth, every 6 hours** for analgesia.\n- **1600 mg total per day**, for example 400 mg four times daily.\n\nTell me which dose you want and I'll enter it. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that and I'll enter it with a note documenting your confirmation. I'd recommend checking with pharmacy first."
